  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "表达式$(ab)^8$表示的是因数$a$和$b$的积的乘方．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 160,
      "source_text": "表达式$(ab)^8$表示的是因数$a$和$b$的积的乘方．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "利用乘法交换律和结合律，可以把$(ab)^8$写成因数的幂的积：\n$(ab)^8=\\underbrace{(ab)(ab)\\cdots(ab)}_{8\\text{个}}=\\underbrace{(a\\cdot a\\cdots a)}_{8\\text{个}}\\cdot\\underbrace{(b\\cdot b\\cdots b)}_{8\\text{个}}=a^8b^8$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 160,
      "source_text": "利用乘法交换律和结合律，可以把$(ab)^8$写成因数的幂的积：$(ab)^8=\\underbrace{(ab)(ab)\\cdots(ab)}_{8\\text{个}}=\\underbrace{(a\\cdot a\\cdots a)}_{8\\text{个}}\\cdot\\underbrace{(b\\cdot b\\cdots b)}_{8\\text{个}}=a^8b^8$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "所以，$(ab)^8=a^8b^8$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 160,
      "source_text": "所以，$(ab)^8=a^8b^8$．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "我们看到，积的八次幂等于各因数的八次幂的积．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 160,
      "source_text": "我们看到，积的八次幂等于各因数的八次幂的积．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同样可以证明：\n$(ab)^n=a^nb^n$，\n其中$n$是任一自然数．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 160,
      "source_text": "同样可以证明：$(ab)^n=a^nb^n$，其中$n$是任一自然数．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "多个因数的积的幂也具有这种性质：积的$n$次幂等于各因数的$n$次幂的积．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 161,
      "source_text": "多个因数的积的幂也具有这种性质：积的$n$次幂等于各因数的$n$次幂的积．",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": []
    }
  ],
